{"ref":"BDB, לָהֵן","hw":"לָהֵן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">לָהֵן</span></big>  <strong>conj. on this account, therefore</strong>, <a data-ref=\"Ruth 1:13\" href=\"/Ruth.1.13\">Ru 1:13</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <strong>(</strong>either from <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵן</span> (v. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, הֵ֫מָּה\" href=\"/BDB,_הֵ֫מָּה\", dir=\"rtl\">הֵ֫מָּה</a>); or the Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">לָהֵן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:6\" href=\"/Daniel.2.6\">Dn 2:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:9\" href=\"/Daniel.2.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:24\" href=\"/Daniel.4.24\">4:24</a>: see the Aramaic Lex.<strong>)</strong>","next":"BDB, לַהֲקָה","prev":"BDB, לָהַם"}